<title>UK: MBNA MCCT sets 1.0 bln Dem asset-backed 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>MBNA MCCT sets 1.0 bln Dem asset-backed 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset-backed floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA MCCT 2</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   SPREAD     +9 BP     MATURITY    19.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE  S 25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES 20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    FFRT	DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  0.025</p>
<p>FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
